        "seg_cer": 0.087,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "东邑景色的生态美景也吸引了好多市民游客前来打卡。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 47.616,
      "end": 50.532,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "记录下眼前的美景。我经常过来的，",
      "score": 0.2194,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0995,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.114,
        "seg_cer": 0.643,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "吉鲁霞烟钱了没？经我正常过来的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 50.532,
      "end": 53.064,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "我一路上看了很多地方，",
      "score": 0.5657,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.0726,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.1,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "我一路上看看很多地方。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 53.064,
      "end": 57.56,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个地方是最漂亮的，有新的银杏树啊，有古老的啊，",
      "score": 0.0218,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0032,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.048,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个地方是最漂亮的，有新的银杏树啊，有古老的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 57.792,
      "end": 59.88,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "挺不错的。去年那个银杏，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9009,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.4,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "挺不错的。去年买过一套。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 60.201,
      "end": 66.676,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "真的是的银杏树好漂亮。所以呢，今年呢，我就带着我一帮朋友过来看到。",
      "score": 0.0631,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0227,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.138,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "觉得自己银杏树好漂亮，所以呢，今年呢，我就带着我一帮朋友过来看到。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 66.676,
      "end": 71.184,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "去年还要漂亮，我这帮朋友看到都挺开心，",
      "score": 0.5738,
